=== CONFLICTS ===
# PINNED, #1223 (medaka test <dir>: one declaration, two module ids, one process).
# ⚠️ THESE ROWS DRAIN BY REVIEW, NOT MECHANICALLY. The `single` arm's "__user__" is
# a SHAPE MODEL spelled in this probe, not read from compiler/tools/test_cmd.mdk,
# so unifying the drivers will NOT flip these rows on its own. Whoever fixes #1223
# must delete them here by hand. (Sourcing the id from the driver would make it
# mechanical; that is a change to test_cmd.mdk and is deliberately not in this PR.)
alpha Cat flat=- single=mod:__user__ graph=mod:alpha
